{"id": "tea:avyakta-upanisad:1", "source": "src:avyakta-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "1"}, "paraphrase": "In the beginning there was the unmanifest light; it became twofold, green (māyā) and red (puruṣa); from their union came the golden egg and Parameṣṭhin, who asked 'what is my family, what my task?'; a voice told him to know by austerity.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "cosmic", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["world-fate"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "high", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
